<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - SECURITIES COMMISSION REGISTRATIONS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - SECURITIES COMMISSION REGISTRATIONS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's securities</p>
<p>comission said on Monday it registered share issues for the</p>
<p>following companies on Friday.</p>
<p>			  Share capital   New issue   Share capital</p>
<p>								after the issue</p>
<p>FROM ADDITIONAL</p>
<p>CONTRIBUTIONS</p>
<p>- Medienos Plaushas   20,127,610    8,000,000   28,127,610</p>
<p>- Butinges Nafta	71,266,300    188,733,700 260,000,000</p>
<p>- Siauliu Bank	  20,021,000    14,000,000  34,021,000</p>
<p>- Mazeikiu Dairy	8,808,285     6,000,000   14,808, 285</p>
<p>- Elektronas	    2,789,271     488,392     3,277,663</p>
<p>FROM COMPANY'S RESERVES</p>
<p>- Shvyturys brewery   7,074,820     4,272,780   11,347,600</p>
<p>- Klaipeda transport</p>
<p>  fleet		   85,977,536    14,749,082  100,726,618</p>
<p>All the figures are in litas. The litas is pegged to the</p>
<p>dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
